recorded 2026-11-14 8.1.17 neutralized
The T039 recording of StartCLI trace --reset on a non-production 8.1.17 node with the 8.1.17 client, run right after the set_ok recording: exit 0, stdout only the client preamble (the JAVA_HOME line, the password prompt, the hostname verification warning, an empty line), stderr only the JVM notice about JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS. There is no confirmation line: StartCLI prints no n-OK line for the CommandResult("OK") of this form. The reset names no logger, and no logger name appears in the output. Neutralized as in research D-26: the trust-store path in the JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS notice is replaced by /home/jdoe/.config/inubit-mcp/acme-truststore.p12; the output names no host.
